; Otter Raid -- title logo (hires, text charset $80-$FF)
; '#' on, '.' off.  The image is cut into 8x8 cells; identical
; cells are shared, blank cells use $20.  Rows 0-4 (40 px) are the
; letters, rows 5-6 their rippled reflection on the river.  The
; engine colours each 8-px cell ROW separately (gradient/cycling).
